*%            *Cmd: "<1F6000>"
*%        }
*%    }
*%    *case: Option2
*%    {
*%        *Command: CmdStartDoc
*%        {
*%  *Order: DOC_SETUP.60  *% double sided mode, double sided commands
*%            *Cmd: "<1F6002>"
*%        }
*%    }
*%} *%switch TwoSidedThermal

*Command: CmdBoldOn { *Cmd : "<1B>E<01>" }
*Command: CmdBoldOff { *Cmd : "<1B>E<00>" }
*Command: CmdItalicOn { *Cmd : "<1B>I1" }
*Command: CmdItalicOff { *Cmd : "<1B>I0" }
*Command: CmdUnderlineOn { *Cmd : "<1B>-1" }
*Command: CmdUnderlineOff { *Cmd : "<1B>-0" }
